    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="className2Node" kindref="compound">Name2Node</ref> iterates over the AST and finds nodes that correspond to names It looks for any SgInitializedName, SgThisExp, or SgFunctionDefinitions and adds them to a string to node* map that can be read with <ref refid="className2Node_1ac4664b3ff7eb25d28b8ed2c5678ed4e9" kindref="member">getFunction()</ref> or <ref refid="className2Node_1a9e16a845b7f46725c7a8e171ce52e061" kindref="member">getVariable()</ref> </para>    </briefdescription>
